# Check Fix

After editing TypeScript in this repo, run from the repo root until it passes:

```bash
bun run check:fix
```

Runs format (`oxfmt`), lint autofix (`oxlint --fix`), and typecheck (`tsc`). Fix any failures, then re-run. Treat the task as done only after it passes (or before commit, if asked).

Skip when the user explicitly says not to run checks.
